{"about_the_game":"Smile For Me is an unconventional Point-and-Click Adventure Game that puts <strong><i>you</i></strong> at the center of an abstract world! Nod and shake your head to chat with new friends, and solve their mysteries to cheer them up.<br><br>The People are bizarre, the Puzzles are Wack, and the World hides a sinister secret...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/275a315c61a6fb333c26166b343eb9c6.poster.avif?t=1746734374\" width=640 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/275a315c61a6fb333c26166b343eb9c6.webm?t=1746734374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/275a315c61a6fb333c26166b343eb9c6.mp4?t=1746734374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep Your Chin Up</h2>You may be silent, but you\u2019ve got a lot to say! Nod-and-shake your way through the Habitat, with a host of funky and friendly characters.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/83662f3f1a9c57cf27ecd27feb5eef64.poster.avif?t=1746734374\" width=638 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/83662f3f1a9c57cf27ecd27feb5eef64.webm?t=1746734374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/83662f3f1a9c57cf27ecd27feb5eef64.mp4?t=1746734374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Quaint Cast of Misfits</h2>The Habiticians are full of juicy gossip. Learn their quirks and qualms, and cure them of their blues!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/8beb3293e1e1a30715a65952c5d0388b.poster.avif?t=1746734374\" width=638 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/8beb3293e1e1a30715a65952c5d0388b.webm?t=1746734374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/8beb3293e1e1a30715a65952c5d0388b.mp4?t=1746734374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your Choice...</h2>Help only your favorite pals, or stay behind to save <i>all</i> the Habiticians.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a beautiful world<br></li><li>Solve a mouthful of tricky puzzles<br></li><li>Chat with 23 peculiar characters</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But that\u2019s not all!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are charming animations!<br></li><li>Secret backstories!<br></li><li>TOO much gossip!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There\u2019s <strong>more!!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Emotional baggage!<br></li><li>Alarming puppetry!<br></li><li>A condescending narrator!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>KEEP IT GOING!!!</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Depressed clowns!</i><br></li><li><i>Fear of mortality!</i><br></li><li><i>The true meaning of friendship!</i><br></li><li><i><strong>Where am I?!?</strong></i></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"05c81b8f7021cc1979b567a9a7327346ee36c4de.jpg","localized_name":" Goodie Two-Shoes","name":" Goodie Two-Shoes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1018850/05c81b8f7021cc1979b567a9a7327346ee36c4de.jpg"},{"icon":"53862ab20a3de6412cdad58aa88e8ff6fd905c63.jpg","localized_name":" Nosey Posey","name":" Nosey Posey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1018850/5386