</i></strong> at the center of an abstract world! Nod and shake your head to chat with new friends, and solve their mysteries to cheer them up.<br><br>The People are bizarre, the Puzzles are Wack, and the World hides a sinister secret...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/275a315c61a6fb333c26166b343eb9c6.poster.avif?t=1746734374\" width=640 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/275a315c61a6fb333c26166b343eb9c6.webm?t=1746734374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/275a315c61a6fb333c26166b343eb9c6.mp4?t=1746734374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep Your Chin Up</h2>You may be silent, but you\u2019ve got a lot to say! Nod-and-shake your way through the Habitat, with a host of funky and friendly characters.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/83662f3f1a9c57cf27ecd27feb5eef64.poster.avif?t=1746734374\" width=638 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/83662f3f1a9c57cf27ecd27feb5eef64.webm?t=1746734374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018850/extras/83662f3f1a9c57cf27ecd27feb5eef64.mp4?t=1746734374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Quaint Cast of Misfits</h2>The Habiticians are full of juicy gossip. Learn their quirks and qualms, and cure them of their blues!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset